{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "novasafe-api-collection-2024",
		"name": "NovaSafe API Collection",
		"description": "Complete API collection for NovaSafe - Secure Digital Vault Application\n\n**Base URL:** `http://localhost:3123` (Development)\n**API Version:** 1.0\n**Authentication:** JWT Bearer Token (except login endpoints)\n\n## Setup Instructions:\n1. Import this collection into Postman\n2. Create an environment with the following variables:\n   - `base_url`: http://localhost:3123\n   - `auth_token`: (will be set automatically after login)\n   - `user_id`: (will be set automatically after login)\n   - `item_id`: (for testing item operations)\n   - `folder_id`: (for testing folder operations)\n   - `share_id`: (for testing share operations)\n3. Run the \"Google Sign-In\" request first to get your auth token\n4. The token will be automatically saved to the environment variable",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Authentication & Authorization",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Google Sign-In",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    const response = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (response.token) {",
									"        pm.environment.set('auth_token', response.token);",
									"        pm.environment.set('user_id', response.user.id);",
									"        console.log('Auth token saved to environment');",
									"    }",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"credential\": \"YOUR_GOOGLE_ID_TOKEN_HERE\"\n}",
							"options": {
								"raw": {
									"language": "json"
								}
							}
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/v/auth/google",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"v",
								"auth",
								"google"
							]
						},
						"description": "Authenticate user with Google OAuth 2.0 and receive JWT token.\n\n**Note:** Replace `YOUR_GOOGLE_ID_TOKEN_HERE` with the actual Google ID token from your frontend OAuth flow."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Get Current User",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/v/auth/me",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"v",
								"auth",
								"me"
							]
						},
						"description": "Retrieve authenticated user's information."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Logout",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/v/auth/logout",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"v",
								"auth",
								"logout"
							]
						},
						"description": "Logout current user and invalidate session."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			],
			"description": "Authentication and authorization endpoints"
		},
