				{
					"name": "Add Item",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
									"    const response = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (response.id) {",
									"        pm.environment.set('item_id', response.id);",
									"        console.log('Item ID saved to environment:', response.id);",
									"    }",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}"
							},
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Gmail Account\",\n  \"category\": \"password\",\n  \"encrypted_data\": \"base64_encoded_aes256_gcm_ciphertext_here\",\n  \"iv\": \"base64_encoded_12_byte_iv_here\",\n  \"field_count\": 3,\n  \"attachment_count\": 0,\n  \"folderId\": null,\n  \"tags\": [\"email\", \"google\"],\n  \"isFavorite\": false\n}",
							"options": {
								"raw": {
									"language": "json"
								}
							}
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/v/addItem",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"v",
								"addItem"
							]
						},
						"description": "Create a new vault item.\n\n**Important:** All sensitive data must be encrypted client-side before sending.\n\n**Required Fields:**\n- `title`: Item title\n- `category`: Item category (e.g., \"password\", \"credit_card\")\n- `encrypted_data`: Base64 encoded AES-256-GCM ciphertext containing all sensitive fields\n- `iv`: Base64 encoded 12-byte initialization vector\n- `field_count`: Number of encrypted fields\n- `attachment_count`: Number of attachments (default: 0)\n\n**Optional Fields:**\n- `folderId`: Folder ID this item belongs to\n- `tags`: Array of tags\n- `isFavorite`: Whether item is favorited"
					},
					"response": []
				},
