								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"v",
								"share",
								"create"
							]
						},
						"description": "Share an item or folder with another user.\n\n**Required Fields:**\n- `recipientEmail`: Email address of the user to share with\n- `shareType`: Type of share: `\"item\"` or `\"folder\"`\n- `resourceId`: MongoDB ObjectId of the item or folder to share\n- `permission`: Permission level: `\"view\"` (read-only) or `\"edit\"` (read-write)\n- `wrappedKey`: Base64 encoded RSA-OAEP encrypted item encryption key\n- `wrappedKeyIV`: Base64 encoded 12-byte IV (for compatibility)\n\n**Optional Fields:**\n- `message`: Optional message/note from sharer to recipient\n- `integrityHash`: Base64 encoded SHA-256 hash of resource for tampering detection\n\n**Note:** `wrappedKey` is the AES key of the resource, encrypted with recipient's public key (RSA-OAEP)."
					},
					"response": []
